      "author_association": "MEMBER",
      "body": "I think when the issue is: `My cat walked over the keyboard while I was starting Bitcoin Core and this resulted in \"invalid\" options`, it could make sense to wait for some larger reason first. If the issue is something that a well-educated user may run into due to misunderstanding or if there are real reports, it can be fixed. I'd say it is a case-by-case basis for now.",
